## Overview

MusGo-OS 2in1 adalah **Sovereign AI Operating Civilization**: sistem operasi kedaulatan digital yang memadukan **Musyawarah** (deliberation berbasis weighted voting konsensus 75%) dan **Gotong-Royong** (eksekusi kooperatif multi-agent) di atas fondasi **Zero Trust**, constitutional governance, dan Keras 3 multi-backend.

## Core Flow (IP Utama — PROPRIETARY)

```
Task Request → Musyawarah (weighted voting 75%) → LEGITIMATE
→ NoBypassGate → GoRo Executor (paralel) → Completion
```

- **Musyawarah Planner** (Layer 02) + **GoRo Executor** (Layer 03) = Framework Core & IP utama.
- NoBypassGate: tanpa tanda tangan LEGITIMATE → **deny**; nonce anti-replay window 30 detik; MAC constant-time.
- Signature Engine: quorum 75%, ledger hash-chain + HMAC.
- GoRo Executor: TaskGraph dependency resolver + deteksi siklus, worker pool maksimal 8.

