## AI Backend

Backend AI resmi: **Keras 3** multi-backend (jax / tensorflow / torch) — artefak `.keras` v3 backend-agnostic.
`Framework/keras3/framework_config` mengunci `KERAS_BACKEND` sebelum import keras; model registry hash-chain SHA-256 + HMAC.

## Security Constitution

- Secure-by-default, fail-closed, deny-by-default, least privilege
- Replay-safe (nonce monoton), hash-chain + HMAC-SHA256, secret vault-only (`MUSGO_VAULT_*`)
- Zero Trust, mTLS-ready, air-gap ready, quantum-resilient roadmap (CRYSTALS-Dilithium)
- Root of Trust Layer 00: `vault/hardware_key_manager/GENESIS_INIT/sovereign_init.py` — jalankan HANYA di mesin air-gapped

